# ===================================================================
# What is NOT in this repo, and why.
#
# The working folder is ~274MB; this repo is ~30MB. The difference is
# entirely SOURCE ART MASTERS and regenerable output. Everything needed
# to build, run, understand and re-derive the site is committed.
#
# THE MASTERS ARE NOT BACKED UP BY THIS REPO. They live in the working
# folder on VEN's machine (and wherever he keeps them). If they matter
# long-term they want a real backup — Drive, an external disk, a
# separate LFS repo — because git history is forever and 176MB of PNG
# and traced SVG in it is a cost every clone pays for good.
# ===================================================================

# ---- the deployable, rebuilt by `node tools/build.js` --------------
# Vercel runs that build itself (vercel.json), so a committed copy
# would only ever be a stale duplicate of the real thing.
/dist/

# ---- top-level source masters (~176MB) -----------------------------
# The originals and their traced vector exports. Leading slashes
# matter: art/village/b-*.png are the SHIPPED sprites and are kept.
/Background.svg
/BackgroundPNG.png
/*.svg
/Changdeokgung*
/Gyeongbokgung*
/Jeonju*
/Namsangol*
/b-*.png
/field-square.png
/valley*.png
/valley*
/hand drawn reference.jpg
# the journey map masters (session 12) — 25MB each, 4K OpenArt output.
# `-plain` is the pre-vignette terrain (the base for future re-edits),
# `-alt` the runner-up vignette variant. art/journey/*.png are the
# SHIPPED preps and are kept.
/map-*-master*.png
/map-ink-master*.png
/map-pirate-master*.png

# ---- village art that is not the village art -----------------------
# _fake:        placeholder state plates from the abandoned states
#               route (HANDOFF §9e). Dead — see §9n.
# _placeholder: the pre-painting stand-in sprites.
# alt:          alternative plate treatments, kept for comparison.
art/village/_fake/
art/village/_placeholder/
art/village/alt/

# ---- regenerable tool output ---------------------------------------
# All of these come back with one command:
#   node tools/plots.js --want 60      -> plots-debug.png, plots-reject.png
#   node tools/render.js 60 tools/render.png
tools/*.png

# ---- local / machine ------------------------------------------------
.vercel
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
node_modules/
.claude/settings.local.json

# the map route debug render, regenerable with maproute --debug
art/journey/*-route.png

# the crew (crew-test): OpenArt stills, re-cut QA sheets and zooms.
# 4MB each and regenerable — their OpenArt URLs are in art/crew/README.md.
# Zico's original and the two chosen clips live in art/crew/src/ and ARE kept.
art/crew/_work/
